    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, why did u say their views are \"misguided\"? if someone thinks that protecting local jobs or national security is more important than cheap consumer goods, isn't that just a different value system rather than being objectively wrong? isn't there a legitimate economic argument for protecting domestic industries too?",
